and most of my guests,

00:01:18.068 --> 00:01:19.973
who get self conscious, you know,

00:01:19.973 --> 00:01:22.373
busy being a general, not busy being on TV

00:01:22.373 --> 00:01:23.752
or things like that.

00:01:23.752 --> 00:01:25.742
But I love the YouTube format.

00:01:25.742 --> 00:01:26.959
I tell people all the time

